    "detailed_description": "\u25aa <strong>The winner is the one with the most money!</strong><br>Who is great at looter shooter bounty hunter? There are many ways to earn currency in a match, and you can also spend it on something cool. The top 1 will be who can come up with the best tactics for earning during the match.<br><br>\u25aa Unlock and upgrade <strong>characters with overpowered skills! </strong><br>Choose your own meta gun with which you will win in action against enemy robots and players.<br><br>\u25aa Features: <br>\u25e6 Play with friends,<br>\u25e6 Single-player can be played offline,<br>\u25e6 Competitive multiplayer with the ranking system,<br>\u25e6 Advanced AI robots,<br>\u25e6 Explore the game and find all the hidden achievements,<br>\u25e6 Climb to the top of the leaderboards in global rankings.<br><br>\u0700 Advanced Artificial Intelligence with different combat behavior, which will not let you relax. Also be careful against the <strong><i>Exterminator</i></strong> Boss, who exterminate everything in his path!<br><br>\u0700 Play together with your friends in PVP mode, complete quests, <strong>play offline without the Internet and your progress will still be saved</strong>!<br><br><br> Cyber Soldier is our the first game, we will improve and update it, so we are waiting for your feedback and suggestions. Thank you for playing \u2764 :'\u203a",
    "about_the_game": "\u25aa <strong>The winner is the one with the most money!</strong><br>Who is great at looter shooter bounty hunter? There are many ways to earn currency in a match, and you can also spend it on something cool. The top 1 will be who can come up with the best tactics for earning during the match.<br><br>\u25aa Unlock and upgrade <strong>characters with overpowered skills! </strong><br>Choose your own meta gun with which you will win in action against enemy robots and players.<br><br>\u25aa Features: <br>\u25e6 Play with friends,<br>\u25e6 Single-player can be played offline,<br>\u25e6 Competitive multiplayer with the ranking system,<br>\u25e6 Advanced AI robots,<br>\u25e6 Explore the game and find all the hidden achievements,<br>\u25e6 Climb to the top of the leaderboards in global rankings.<br><br>\u0700 Advanced Artificial Intelligence with different combat behavior, which will not let you relax. Also be careful against the <strong><i>Exterminator</i></strong> Boss, who exterminate everything in his path!<br><br>\u0700 Play together with your friends in PVP mode, complete quests, <strong>play offline without the Internet and your progress will still be saved</strong>!<br><br><br> Cyber Soldier is our the first game, we will improve and update it, so we are waiting for your feedback and suggestions. Thank you for playing \u2764 :'\u203a",
